   "body": "<p>A lira has five lines. The first, third, and fourth have seven syllables. The second and the fifth have eleven. In the first stanza lines 1 and 3 rhyme in <i lang=\"es\">ura</i>, and line 4, which also has seven syllables, rhymes with the two lines of eleven in <i lang=\"es\">ada</i>.</p><p><i lang=\"es\">En una noche oscura</i> joins <i lang=\"es\">noche</i> and <i lang=\"es\">oscura</i>. <i lang=\"es\">En</i>, <i lang=\"es\">u</i>, <i lang=\"es\">na</i>, <i lang=\"es\">no</i>, <i lang=\"es\">cheos</i>, <i lang=\"es\">cu</i>, <i lang=\"es\">ra</i>. That is seven, and <i lang=\"es\">oscura</i> is stressed on the next to last syllable.</p><p><i lang=\"es\">Con ansias en amores inflamada</i> has no synalepha. <i lang=\"es\">Con</i>, <i lang=\"es\">an</i>, <i lang=\"es\">sias</i>, <i lang=\"es\">en</i>, <i lang=\"es\">a</i>, <i lang=\"es\">mo</i>, <i lang=\"es\">res</i>, <i lang=\"es\">in</i>, <i lang=\"es\">fla</i>, <i lang=\"es\">ma</i>, <i lang=\"es\">da</i>. The vowels <i lang=\"es\">ia</i> in <i lang=\"es\">ansias</i> are a diphthong. That is eleven. The stress of <i lang=\"es\">amores</i> falls on <i lang=\"es\">mo</i>, the sixth syllable, and the stress of <i lang=\"es\">inflamada</i> falls on <i lang=\"es\">ma</i>, the tenth.</p><p><i lang=\"es\">Estando ya mi casa sosegada</i> has no synalepha, because the <i lang=\"es\">y</i> of <i lang=\"es\">ya</i> is a consonant here. The line has eleven: <i lang=\"es\">Es</i>, <i lang=\"es\">tan</i>, <i lang=\"es\">do</i>, <i lang=\"es\">ya</i>, <i lang=\"es\">mi</i>, <i lang=\"es\">ca</i>, <i lang=\"es\">sa</i>, <i lang=\"es\">so</i>, <i lang=\"es\">se</i>, <i lang=\"es\">ga</i>, <i lang=\"es\">da</i>. The stress of <i lang=\"es\">casa</i> falls on <i lang=\"es\">ca</i>, the sixth syllable, and the stress of <i lang=\"es\">sosegada</i> falls on <i lang=\"es\">ga</i>, the tenth.</p>"
